       Contents of the READ.ME File
       ----------------------------
    1. CORRECTIONS to the 3.0 Reference Manual        [ All versions ]
    2. OMMISSIONS from the 3.0 Reference Manual       [ All versions ]
    3. New FEATURES                                   [ CP/M-80      ]
    4. ADDITIONAL FILE LIST                           [ CP/M-80      ]


